WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.382
Every missed call. Every slow reply. That's a customer walking straight to your competitor.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:17.428
GoHighLevel brings your whole business into one place: your contacts, website, calendar, email, text messages and WhatsApp.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:25.342
