00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:35.436
Missed a call? It texts them back automatically. And reminders go out before every appointment, so fewer people forget to show up.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:41.792
Happy customers get a review request, so your Google rating grows on autopilot.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:49.822
One platform replaces many of the separate tools you pay for every month, and every lead is tracked from first click to paid.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:01:01.164
Vix Automations sets it all up for you, done for you, in seven to twenty-one days. Message us on WhatsApp, and let's build your twenty-four seven sales machine.
